{
  "_comment": "Bifrost agent launcher registry — defines launchable agents for the Bifrost UI. Edit to add/remove agents. The built-in defaults (deepseek, gemini) are always available; entries here AUGMENT or OVERRIDE them by agent_id. schema_version: 1.",
  "schema_version": 1,
  "agents": [
